        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on current journey map, key gaps, and overall pathway design.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 9716,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I've uploaded the first draft of the current client journey map based on my review of the case files for T1. It's a bit rough but it's a start. Let me know what you think. The main thing I saw was a lot of waiting time for clients between stages.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 6627,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Wow, thanks for getting this done so fast! I'll look now. Yes, the waiting is a huge problem. We should create a new form for handovers, that would speed things up.",
            "mentions": [
              9716
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 76106,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Good work on the map, @9716. It clearly shows the pain points. Based on this, I've sketched out a proposed flow for the new pathway in A1. It introduces a clear 'Assessment & Planning' stage at the start, then 'Skills Building', and finally 'Workplace Transition & Support'. This structure should help.",
            "mentions": [
              9716
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "eyes",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 8393,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Thanks @76106, that structure in A1 makes sense. It aligns well with the need for a holistic assessment upfront, which is part of T2. I think the three stages you proposed are the right ones for the pilot. Does everyone else agree on these as the main stages?",
            "mentions": [
              76106
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 9716,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Yes, I agree with those stages. It's much clearer than what we have now.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 6627,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Yes! Love it. Assessment, Skills, Work. Simple.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "rocket",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 459543,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "The 'Workplace Transition' stage is crucial. We need to make sure the handover from the skills part to the actual move and first day is seamless. The structure looks good.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 76106,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Great, sounds like we have consensus on the pathway stages. Decision: The new pathway will consist of three main stages: 1. Assessment & Planning, 2. Skills Building, 3. Workplace Transition & Support.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 3
