          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 8393,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Perfect. Now for the gaps identified in T1. I see a few, but what are the top priorities we need to solve with this pilot? I'd suggest: 1) Lack of a single, holistic assessment, 2) Poor communication between our teams at handover, and 3) No structured support for clients in their first week of work.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 6627,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "Definitely the communication. It's a mess sometimes. We also need better workshops.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M11",
            "speaker_id": 76106,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "I agree with your three points, @8393. They directly map to the new stages. The holistic assessment (T2) fixes #1, a clear coordination protocol (T6) fixes #2, and the 'Transition & Support' stage design will fix #3.",
            "mentions": [
              8393
