            "speaker_id": 76106,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I've put together the first draft of the employment readiness workshop outline for T3 and the client-facing info pack for T7. They are in the shared folder. The goal is to have 3 core workshops: 1. Workplace Basics, 2. Communicating with Confidence, 3. Managing Your Money and Time. Keen to hear your thoughts.",
