            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 6627,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "This is awesome! I've already got tons of ideas for activities. For the communication one we could do role-playing, and for the money one we could bring in a guest speaker from a bank, and maybe we can do a fourth workshop on digital skills like using email?",
