            "speaker_id": 76106,
            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "Great energy, @6627! Role-playing is a definite yes. A guest speaker might be tricky with the pilot's tight timeline, but we can build a resource sheet. A fourth workshop is a good idea for the future, but let's stick to three for the pilot to keep it manageable. We can weave basic digital skills into the existing three.",
