            "speaker_id": 9716,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "Looking at the info pack (A8). The language is a bit formal. Phrases like 'holistic assessment' and 'interdisciplinary coordination' will probably go over our clients' heads. We need to simplify it a lot.",
