            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 8393,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "I agree with @9716. For A8, we should rephrase 'holistic assessment' to something like 'a chat to understand your needs and goals'. And 'interdisciplinary coordination' could be 'our team working together for you'. Simple, direct language is key.",
            "mentions": [
