            "speaker_id": 8393,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, to get us ready for launch, I've drafted the pilot evaluation plan for T12. It outlines how we'll collect feedback. Alongside this, @76106 has set up the outcome and attendance tracker (A6) for T8. Please take a look.",
