            "speaker_id": 76106,
            "reply_to": "M68",
            "text": "Good thought, @6627. Measuring confidence is important. For the pilot, we're planning to capture that through qualitative feedback in the evaluation (T12) rather than a score in the tracker A6, just to keep the daily tracking simple. We need to focus on a few key, easy-to-measure indicators first.",
            "mentions": [
